<section class="policy-page-section" style="padding: 40px 16px 80px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-main, #1a1a1a);">
  <div class="policy-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #2c7a4b; background: #e8f5ed; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Data Protection</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #1f5735;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 15px;">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-content" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #333;">
    
    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 14px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Shanmukha Stores respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. We collect only the information necessary to provide and enhance our services:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 12px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Account Details:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and password hash.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Delivery Details:</strong> Street address, landmarks, city, pincode, and contact numbers.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Google Profile Data:</strong> When signing in with Google OAuth, we receive your public name, verified email, and profile avatar as authorized by you.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Order Information:</strong> Products purchased, order amounts, and payment method choices.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used strictly to:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 12px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Process, fulfill, and deliver your grocery orders to your doorstep.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Send order updates, tracking alerts, and delivery confirmations via SMS (MSG91) or WhatsApp.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Secure user authentication and fraud prevention.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Improve our product catalog and user experience based on customer demand.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">3. Payment Information Security</h2>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> store credit/debit card numbers, CVVs, or net banking credentials on our servers. Online UPI and payment transactions are handled directly through bank-grade UPI QR standards and certified gateways.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
    <p>We <strong>never sell or rent</strong> your personal information to advertisers. We share details solely with trusted logistics and infrastructure partners (such as delivery dispatchers and cloud hosting providers) strictly necessary to complete your order.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">5. Account Deletion & Queries</h2>
    <p>You may request the deletion of your account and associated personal data at any time by contacting us at <strong>shanmukhastores@yahoo.com</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

